{
  "info": {
    "name": "Business Matching Bridge API",
    "description": "Auth (Supabase) -> Verification -> Opportunity -> Boost -> Matching -> Ranking -> Invitation -> Deal -> Fraud Check.\n\nSet variable `accessToken` dengan Supabase access token (dari sign in di client), lalu jalankan folder secara berurutan: Auth -> Verification -> Opportunity -> Boost -> Matching -> Invitation -> Deal -> Review -> Notification -> Fraud (admin).",
